# Oxygen Dark from KDE's Oxygen (kde-style-oxygen-qt6 4:6.7.4-1+b1, /usr/share/color-schemes/OxygenDark.colors),
# with one change: [WM] activeForeground was 59,57,55 on activeBackground 56,51,49 (contrast 1.08:1), so the
# active window title could not be read with title-bar-coloured decorations such as Plastik (Daniel, 2026-10-31:
# "I barely can read the active window title"). It is now the scheme's own window text, 255,232,223 (about 11:1),
# the value KDE's Oxygen chose for Plasma 6.8 (Benoit Marchand, plasma/oxygen 31fa64d2, 2026-10-19, "Improve active
# titlebar text contrast for Oxygen Dark"); this scheme carries it until Debian ships Oxygen 6.8.

